## Super Admin UX (H4)

**Surfaces:** `apps/web/src/platform/` — create-club wizard + club detail overview.

| Behavior | Implementation |
| -------- | -------------- |
| Workspace catalog | `GET /platform/v1/workspaces` returns `productionTier` + `productionOnboardingAllowed` from `WORKSPACE_PRODUCTION_CERTIFICATION` |
| Create club picker | Stub options **disabled**; certified badge on `denali` |
| Client validation | `validateIdentityStep` rejects `productionTier: stub` |
| Platform saga | `runProvisionTenantSaga` calls `assertProductionCertifiedWorkspaceType` (same gate as H2) |
| Club detail | `WorkspaceProductionCertificationBadge` beside `workspaceType` |

**Excluded from catalog:** `starter` (operator scaffold — not a club workspace target).

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/api exec node --import tsx --test test/list-platform-workspaces.spec.ts
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test test/use-create-club-wizard.spec.ts
pnpm --filter @apps/web exec node --import tsx --test test/workspace-production-certification-badge.spec.ts
node apps/web/scripts/smoke-platform-create-club.mjs
```

